title: "Perturbation structure and imperfect physics in neural PDE forecasting"
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - family-names: Doane
    given-names: Michael
    affiliation: "Independent Researcher, Cary, NC"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - scientific machine learning
  - physics-guided learning
  - neural PDE forecasting
  - data augmentation
  - looped transformers
  - model misspecification
abstract: >-
  Code and archived evaluation results for 864 development fits and 720
  follow-up fits studying physics-generated training examples across eight
  synthetic PDE systems. The study compares perturbation structure, physical
  model mismatch, neural architecture, resolution, and augmentation selection.
